          the hours you staff. Event nights at AMP, a full patient schedule, and
          the hour a vendor rep is in a meeting are still uncovered unless you
          staff them. A traditional answering service usually bills per minute
          or per call, reads a script they did not write with you, and hands
          you a message. The booking and the dispatch are still your job the
          next morning.
